IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-FEDERATED-V3.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-NODES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ADAPTER-DIM         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CONSENSUS-US        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FEDERATED-V3.
    IF NUM-NODES == 0 OR ADAPTER-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 78 TO CONSENSUS-US.
    MOVE 17800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-NODES.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
